<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-25T22:42:06.940Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:42:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have intensified attacks in Nigeria's Plateau region, killing a woman harvesting groundnuts and injuring two farmers, while Fulani attackers killed a farmer and wounded another in a separate raid. In eastern Nigeria, gunmen killed at least ten people and later reports indicate death tolls rising to forty in a village raid after Friday prayers. Bandits kidnapped two farmers in Kaduna and rescued 70 abducted persons were recovered by troops. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPMlZFMnhUNjg4eGdjbW9hOGdHNVgyb2o4ZzUzem9OUW5pQUxDcGZDdDhYTDNWS25YeDN6M25CTWRNQUxGaURhWUZhRjUzX0tKbVl1YnJIVVFPSkk2a29nUWVuZEY1aVJvUWJpRkJ4YnBlbXFFUzlrbkQzUlZhT0lvbHR3aWZKQ3VhTXFFWWJpZ3VCV2V6OHdmeGVsTGhEa3R0eURPRjZCZXQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Apa.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOVlpadmpscVdaQnhhWXR1Q2Zyc3B2RXFhcFlfQ195NHVJaXpIOXFGWEI2TTRSSjI5TVVpc3BoVWlzbE9BZC1ZdlZWM0JGTl9xd0E5QlZuT0RtS2FtSWVsN01zeDdDdjdxUkFrUzdiSzFGSHlsd25aRU9SbXVzUGpTR1V6clktQmFITUJqOVBBYUZBNm16aFlVRFlud0Z3LXNKOU5OTmlvTjRldw?oc=5&quot;&gt;zagazola.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9iaTFvb3ZERThsd0tVUFlJbW9Dck5SbHBQdmxycDBad3RCUkVvSGJZZ1R6WHdZaVc3ZVBhcHVLbms2RXFjS1NJeWo4SURza29XOEpDZjhMRWVYWFRXZTdpTHhqMjc3ck51R1FGOFFqUE53WjRxNHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu